{
  "description": "Single-defect recipes: each case applies its edits to a valid recipe (valid/<base>.json; set replaces or adds the value at the path, delete removes it) and names the validator's code and JSON path. by: schema means recipe-schema.json refuses it too (JSON Schema Draft 2020-12); by: validator means only mapper.py does, and the schema admits it.",
